  "outstanding_asks": [
    {
      "by": "greptile-apps",
      "ask": "<a href=\"#\"><img alt=\"P1\" src=\"https://greptile-static-assets.s3.amazonaws.com/badges/p1.svg?v=9\" align=\"top\"></a> **State-reading wraps escape the check**\n\nAn app wrap that opts out of memoization still escapes this check. For example, put `UnmemoizedLabel.create(label=DynState.label)` in `app.extra_app_wraps` with `enable_state=False` and a static page. `MemoizationDisposition.NEVER` keeps its state hook in `app_root`, but `compile_app_root` runs after this check. Compilation therefore succeeds and leaves the missing-state failure for the browser. Check the compiled app root too, and add this case to the tests.\n\n**Knowledge Base Used:** [Frontend compilation pipeline](https://app.greptile.com/reflex-org-2/-/custom-context/knowledge-base/reflex-dev/reflex/-/docs/frontend-compilation.md)",
